# Heavy downloaded documentation, SDKs, archives, and extracted tools.
# Keep lightweight project notes under doc/*.md tracked by explicit git add.
doc/**
!doc/
!doc/*.md
!doc/hardware_manuals/
!doc/hardware_manuals/README.md
!doc/competition_materials/
!doc/competition_materials/README.md

